        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "f7d5f0de-ebf2-5668-bbb0-0b230059b0a0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Robinsons-May, The May Department Stores Company, Federated Department Stores, Macy's, Inc.\n- Places: Simi Valley Town Center, Simi Valley, California\n- Organizations: KWSV-LP, 99.1 The Ranch\n- Topics: acquisitions, mergers, anchor stores, radio broadcasting\n\nFacts:\n- The May Department Stores Company was founded by David May in 1877.\n- Federated Department Stores acquired The May Department Stores Company on August 30, 2005.\n- The May Department Stores Company merged with Federated Department Stores in 2005, and Federated Department Stores is now Macy's, Inc.\n- Robinsons-May was a subsidiary of The May Department Stores Company before Federated Department Stores took over The May Department Stores Company.\n- Simi Valley Town Center opened in 2005 with Macy's and Robinsons-May as anchor stores.\n- KWSV-LP, branded as 99.1 The Ranch, is a low-power non-commercial country radio station with studios inside Simi Valley Town Center in Simi Valley, California.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
